Description	"Darth Sidious

The Emperor himself. A powerful but relatively frail Sith with fast Force regen and potent dark side abilities, including a corkscrew special.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- Lightweight
-- 10% faster RoF
- Lightsaber (Optional)
-- Saber Defense (2)
-- Blaster Defense (1)
-- 86% more special damage
-- Saber Throw ^3[CS1]

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (3)
- Pull (3)
- Sense (3)
- Lightning (3) ^3[CS4]
- Grip (3) ^3[CS3]

^8Attributes:
- Healing (1)
- Dexterity (3)
- Force Block/Focus (3)"